doc:sch-1-sec-94g a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "94G Decrypting COVID app data" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person decrypts encrypted data; and  (b) the data is COVID app data that is stored on a communication device. Penalty: Imprisonment for 5 years or 300 penalty units, or both." ;
