    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The data store administrator must take all reasonable steps to ensure that COVID app data is not retained on a communication device:  (a) for more than 21 days; or  (b) in any case in which it is not possible to comply with paragraph (a) within 21 days—for longer than the shortest practicable period.  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 44, 2020 Privacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020" ;
