concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3 cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-public-health-contact-information-act-2020-sch-1-sec-94s-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3 .
