    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), the Health Minister must, by notifiable instrument, determine a day if the Health Minister is satisfied that, by that day, use of COVIDSafe:  (a) is no longer required to prevent or control; or  (b) is no longer likely to be effective in preventing or controlling;  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 44, 2020 Privacy Amendment (Public Health Contact Information) Act 2020  the entry, emergence, establishment or spread of the coronavirus known as COVID-19 into Australia or any part of Australia."@en ;
